# SPA fallback ONLY for path-style deep links (/playlist/<uuid>). The embed is normally loaded via
# `/?id=<uuid>` (a query on `/`), which needs no rule. Scoping to /playlist/* is important: a broad
# `/*  /index.html  200` catch-all would shadow /assets/*.js and serve index.html (text/html) for
# them, which the browser refuses to run as a module (MIME mismatch under X-Content-Type-Options).
/playlist/*   /index.html   200
